qore-nats-module (1.0.0~git20260928.1-0qore1~ubuntu26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Package native bindings, three compiled/source user modules, metadata,
    resources/translations, API docs, test examples and debug symbols.
  * Use distribution libnats 3.12 and an isolated local broker for tests.
  * Remove the obsolete upstream error-counter patch already in nats.c 3.12.
  * Match the CMake minimum to COPY_FILE and declare NatsUtil dependencies.
  * Record an explicit QUnit skip when the optional NATS CLI is unavailable.
  * Add installed runtime/compiler tests and reproducible offline profiles.

 -- David Nichols <david@qore.org>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 02:55:59 -0000
